{"name":"High Noon","hex":"#cfb999","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"high noon","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Exactly noon; midday (when the sun is at its highest).","The zenith or apex of one's life or of a certain activity or era."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/high_noon"}],"entries":[{"title":"High Noon","blocks":[{"text":"High Noon is a 1952 American Western film directed by Fred Zinnemann, produced by Stanley Kramer, and starring Gary Cooper, Grace Kelly, Katy Jurado, Thomas Mitchell, Lloyd Bridges, and Otto Kruger. The screenplay by Carl Foreman is based on John W. Cunningham's short story \"The Tin Star\", first published in Collier's magazine in 1947. The plot, which occurs in real time, centers on a town marshal whose sense of duty is tested when he must decide to either face a gang of killers alone, or leave town with his new wife."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/High_Noon_%281952_poster%29.jpg/330px-High_Noon_%281952_poster%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/High_Noon","wikidata":"Q245208"},{"title":"High Noon (seltzer)","blocks":[{"text":"High Noon is an American alcoholic beverage brand specializing in hard seltzer made with vodka and fruit juice. Introduced in 2019 by American wine and spirits company E & J Gallo Winery, High Noon is the top-selling spirit brand by volume in the United States as of 2023."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/High_Noon_logo.png/330px-High_Noon_logo.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/High_Noon_(seltzer)","wikidata":"Q126478251"},{"title":"Noon","blocks":[{"text":"Noon is 12 o'clock in the daytime."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b6/%D0%91%D0%B0%D0%BA%D1%83._%D0%A3%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B0_%D0%B2_%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%8C._1861.jpg/330px-%D0%91%D0%B0%D0%BA%D1%83._%D0%A3%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B0_%D0%B2_%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%8C._1861.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Noon","wikidata":"Q168182"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/Gary_Cooper_in_High_Noon_1952.JPG/500px-Gary_Cooper_in_High_Noon_1952.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/Gary_Cooper_in_High_Noon_1952.JPG/1280px-Gary_Cooper_in_High_Noon_1952.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/Gary_Cooper_in_High_Noon_1952.JPG/500px-Gary_Cooper_in_High_Noon_1952.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Gary Cooper as Marshal Will Kane","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGary_Cooper_in_High_Noon_1952.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/GraceKellyHighNoonTrailerScreenshot1952.jpg/500px-GraceKellyHighNoonTrailerScreenshot1952.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/GraceKellyHighNoonTrailerScreenshot1952.jpg/1280px-GraceKellyHighNoonTrailerScreenshot1952.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/GraceKellyHighNoonTrailerScreenshot1952.jpg/500px-GraceKellyHighNoonTrailerScreenshot1952.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Grace Kelly as Amy Fowler Kane","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGraceKellyHighNoonTrailerScreenshot1952.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ad/Kelly-Cooper-Jurado.jpg/500px-Kelly-Cooper-Jurado.jpg?u